    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Fertile soils in Pittsylvania County turned Blairs into a tobacco hub, with plantations and family farms shaping the landscape.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://usapulse.blog/blairs-virginia-5-hidden-charms-guide"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Civil War left an indelible mark on Blairs, as the town and surrounding county endured the conflict’s upheaval.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8,
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://usapulse.blog/blairs-virginia-5-hidden-charms-guide"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "A Virginia Historical Marker across from the post office marks where the original tavern stood, honoring early settlers.",
